{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1569", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "easy", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "sirpi_ilanthamizhe", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘செம்பரிதி மலைமேட்டில் தலையைச் சாய்ப்பான்... செந்நிறத்துப் பூக்காடாம் வானமெல்லாம்’ - எனத் தமிழ்மொழியின் பெருமையைப் பாடிய சாகித்திய அகாதெமி கவிஞர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "சிற்பி பாலசுப்பிரமணியம்", "B": "வைரமுத்து", "C": "அப்துல் ரகுமான்", "D": "மு. மேத்தா"}, "explanation": "சிற்பி பாலசுப்பிரமணியத்தின் 'நிலவுப்பூ' கவிதைத் தொகுப்பில் உள்ள 'இளந்தமிழே' என்ற பாடலின் தொடக்க வரிகள் இவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which Sahitya Akademi winning poet sang 'Semparithi malaimeettil thalaiyais saaippaan...' glorifying the Tamil language?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Sirpi Balasubramaniam", "B": "Vairamuthu", "C": "Abdul Rahman", "D": "Mu. Metha"}, "explanation": "Sirpi Balasubramaniam composed this poem 'Ilanthamizhe' included in his anthology 'Nilavup Poo'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 2, "chapter": null, "section": null, "ref