{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1589", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "nedunalvaadai_thinai_controversy", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "நெடுநல்வாடை அகநூலா அல்லது புறநூலா என்ற விவாதத்தில், அதனைப் புறநூல் எனத் தமிழறிஞர்கள் ஏற்பதற்குக் காரணம் என்ன?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பாட்டுடைத் தலைவனின் அடையாளமான வேப்பம்பூ மாலை பாடலில் வெளிப்படையாகக் குறிப்பிடப்பட்டுள்ளதால்", "B": "அதில் போர் விவரிக்கப்படாததால்", "C": "அது வெண்பாவால் பாடப்பட்டதால்", "D": "அதில் பெண்கள் பாடப்படாததால்"}, "explanation": "தொல்காப்பிய மரபுப்படி அகப்பாடலில் மன்னனின் பெயரோ குல அடையாளமோ வரக்கூடாது. வேப்பம்பூ அடையாளம் சுட்டப்பட்டதால் இது புறநூலாயிற்று."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the critical debate on whether Nedunalvaadai is an Akam or Puram work, why do classical scholars classify it under Puram?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Because the royal ancestral insignia (Veppampoo garland) explicitly specifies an identifiable historical king", "B": "Because battle warfare is absent", "C": "Because it is composed in Venba", "D": "Because women are excluded"}, "explanation": "Tholkappiyam dictates Akam poetry must never identify real historical individuals; naming the neem garland placed it in Puram."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 32, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_1, Page 32", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 1", "Mock 1", "Tholkappiyam Poetics"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
