{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1628", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "easy", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "purananooru_avvaiyar_athiyan", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘இவ்வே பீலி அணிந்து மாலை சூட்டி... அவ்வே பகைவர்குத்தி கோடுசிதைந்து கொல்லன் உலையிற் கிடப்பனவே’ - அதியமானின் ஆயுதங்களை ஔவையார் எந்த நூலில் பாடியுள்ளார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அகநானூறு", "B": "நற்றிணை", "C": "கலித்தொகை", "D": "புறநானூறு (பாடல் 95)"}, "explanation": "தொண்டைமான் படைக்கலக் கொட்டிலையும், அதியமானின் போர்க்களப் புண்பட்ட வேல்களையும் ஒப்பிட்டு ஔவையார் புறநானூற்றில் பாடியுள்ளார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In which Sangam anthology did Avvaiyar sing the iconic verse contrasting Thondaiman's polished spears with Adiyaman's scarred battlefield weapons?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Agananuru", "B": "Natrinai", "C": "Kalithogai", "D": "Purananuru (Verse 95)"}, "explanation": "Avvaiyar sang this verse in Purananuru 95 as a diplomatic ambassador deterring war."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 86, "chapter": null,