{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1632", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "road_safety_golden_hour", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சாலைப் பாதுகாப்பில் விபத்து நடந்த முதல் ஒரு மணி நேரத்திற்கு என்ன பெயர்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வெள்ளி மணி", "B": "சிவப்பு மணி", "C": "ஆபத்து நேரம்", "D": "தங்க மணித்துளிகள் (Golden Hour)"}, "explanation": "விபத்து நடந்த முதல் ஒரு மணி நேரத்திற்குள் மருத்துவ உதவி கிடைத்தால் உயிரைக் காப்பாற்ற முடியும் என்பதால் இது 'தங்க மணித்துளிகள்' எனப்படும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In trauma care and road safety guidelines, what is the critical first 60 minutes following an accident termed?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Silver Hour", "B": "Red Hour", "C": "Hazard Time", "D": "The Golden Hour"}, "explanation": "The first hour post-injury when prompt medical care can avert fatality is globally termed the 'Golden Hour'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 92, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_1, Page 92", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 1", "Mock 3", "Road Safety"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1633", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "uvamai_uruvagam_diff", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘உவமை’ மற்றும் ‘உருவகம்’ ஆகியவற்றுக்கு இடையேயான நுட்பமான வேறுபாடு யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "உவமையில் உவமானம் வேறு, உவமேயம் வேறு எனத் தனித்து நிற்கும்; உருவகத்தில் இரண்டும் ஒன்றே என வேற்றுமை இன்றி இணையும்", "B": "உவமை உரைநடையில் மட்டுமே வரும்", "C": "உருவகம் பழங்காலத்தில் மட்டுமே பயன்படுத்தப்பட்டது", "D": "இரண்டும் முற்றிலும் ஒரே இலக்கண அமைப்பைக் கொண்டவை"}, "explanation": "‘மலர்முகம்’ என்பது உவமை (மலர்போன்ற முகம்); ‘முகமலர்’ என்பது உருவகம் (முகமே மலராக இருத்தல்). இதுவே உவமைக்கும் உருவகத்திற்குமான வேறுபாடாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What is the subtle grammatical and aesthetic distinction between a Simile (Uvamai) and a Metaphor (Uruwagam)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "In a simile, the vehicle and tenor stand distinct; in a metaphor, both merge seamlessly without distinction into a single identity", "B": "Similes appear strictly in prose", "C": "Metaphors were restricted exclusively to ancient eras", "D": "Both possess entirely identical syntactical structures"}, "explanation": "A simile preserves comparison markers keeping tenor and vehicle distinct; a metaphor fuses them into an indivisible unity."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 96, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_1, Page 96", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 1", "Mock 3", "Rhetoric"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1634", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "easy", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "suradha_thalaivar_awards", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சுரதா அவர்கள் தமிழ்நாடு அரசின் பாரதிதாசன் விருதையும், தஞ்சைத் தமிழ்ப் பல்கலைக்கழகத்தின் எந்த விருதையும் பெற்றுள்ளார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கபிலர் விருது", "B": "இராஜராஜன் விருது", "C": "கம்பன் விருது", "D": "திருவள்ளுவர் விருது"}, "explanation": "சுரதாவின் கவிதைப் பணிகளுக்காகத் தஞ்சைத் தமிழ்ப் பல்கலைக்கழகம் அவருக்கு உயரிய 'இராஜராஜன் விருது' வழங்கிச் சிறப்பித்தது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Along with the Bharathidasan State Award, which prestigious honor was conferred upon Suradha by Thanjavur Tamil University?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Kabilar Award", "B": "Rajarajan Award", "C": "Kamban Award", "D": "Thiruvalluvar Award"}, "explanation": "Tamil University, Thanjavur, honored poet Suradha with the prestigious Rajarajan Award."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 79, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "1