{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1635", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "palm_leaf_cutting_tools", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பண்டைய காலத்தில் ஏடுகளை எழுதவும், ஏடுகளை நறுக்கவும் பயன்படுத்தப்பட்ட இரும்புக் கருவி எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கத்தி", "B": "அரிவாள்", "C": "எழுத்தாணி (மற்றும் வார்ப்புக்கூறு/மடக்கு எழுத்தாணி)", "D": "ஊசி"}, "explanation": "ஓலைச்சுவடிகளில் எழுதப் பயன்பட்ட கூரிய முனை கொண்ட கருவிக்கு 'எழுத்தாணி' என்று பெயர். இதில் மடக்கு எழுத்தாணி, குண்டு எழுத்தாணி எனப் பல வகைகள் உண்டு."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What traditional iron stylus instrument was utilized in ancient Tamil Nadu to etch and trim palm-leaf manuscripts?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Knife", "B": "Sickle", "C": "Ezhuththaani (Iron stylus including folding styluses)", "D": "Sewing needle"}, "explanation": "The iron stylus (Ezhuththaani), shaped with a writing point and slicing blade, was used for palm-leaf manuscripts."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 74, "chap