{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1647", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "uruvagam_examples", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘அறிவு விளக்கு’, ‘இன்ப வெள்ளம்’, ‘காவியப் பூங்கா’ - இவை எவ்வகை இலக்கிய உத்திக்குச் சான்றுகள்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "உவமையணி", "B": "வஞ்சப்புகழ்ச்சியணி", "C": "உருவகம் (Metaphor)", "D": "சிலேடையணி"}, "explanation": "அறிவை விளக்காகவும், இன்பத்தை வெள்ளமாகவும், காவியத்தைப் பூங்காவாகவும் வேற்றுமையின்றி ஒன்றாக்கிப் பாடியுள்ளதால் இவை உருவகங்கள் ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'Arivu Vilakku' (Lamp of Knowledge), 'Inba Vellam' (Flood of Bliss), and 'Kaaviyap Poongaa' (Park of Epics) are examples of which rhetorical device?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Uvamai (Simile)", "B": "Vanchappugazhchi", "C": "Uruwagam (Metaphor)", "D": "Siledai"}, "explanation": "Because the tenor and vehicle are syntactically fused into a single unified compound, they are Metaphors (Uruwagam)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 97, "chapter": null, "sectio