{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1663", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_4", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "suradha_uvamai_kavignar_reason", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சுரதா ‘உவமைக் கவிஞர்’ என்று தமிழ் இலக்கிய உலகால் ஒருமனதாகப் பாராட்டப்படக் காரணம் என்ன?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அவர் ஆங்கிலத்தில் மட்டுமே கவிதை எழுதியதால்", "B": "அவர் உவமைகளைப் பயன்படுத்தாததால்", "C": "ஒவ்வொரு கவிதையிலும் புதுப்புது உவமைகளைக் கையாண்டு உவமையின் வாயிலாகவே கவிதையை மிளிரச் செய்ததால்", "D": "அவர் நாடகம் மட்டுமே இயற்றியதால்"}, "explanation": "சுரதாவின் கவிதைகளில் உவமைகள் புதிய பாய்ச்சலோடும் கற்பனை வனப்போடும் கொட்டிக் கிடப்பதால் அறிஞர் உலகம் அவரை 'உவமைக் கவிஞர்' எனப் போற்றுகிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Why is poet Suradha unanimously celebrated across Tamil literature with the sobriquet 'Uvamai Kavignar' (Poet of Similes)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Because he composed exclusively in English", "B": "Because he rejected similes entirely", "C": "Because he infused every verse with astonishing, original, and evocative similes elevating poetic aesthetics", "D": "Because he wrote only stage plays"}, "explanation": "He is titled 'Uvamai Kavignar' for his breathtaking mastery in inventing fresh, dazzling similes in metered verse."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 79, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_1, Page 79", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 1", "Mock 4", "Poetic Title"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1664", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_4", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "traffic_white_lines", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சாலையின் நடுவே விட்டுவிட்டுப் போடப்படும் வெள்ளைக் கோடுகள் (Broken White Lines) வாகன ஓட்டிகளுக்கு எதனை அனுமதிக்கின்றன?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வாகனத்தை அங்கேயே நிறுத்துவதை", "B": "வேக வரம்பை மீறுவதை", "C": "சாலை விதிகளைப் புறக்கணிப்பதை", "D": "பாதுகாப்பான சூழல் இருப்பின் முன்னால் செல்லும் வாகனத்தை முந்திச் செல்வதையும் (Overtaking) பாதை மாறுவதையும்"}, "explanation": "விட்டுவிட்டுக் காணப்படும் வெள்ளைக் கோடுகள் தேவையான எச்சரிக்கையுடன் எதிரில் வாகனம் வராத போது முந்திச் செல்ல (Overtake) அனுமதிக்கின்றன."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What does a broken white lane line running along the center of a roadway permit motorists to do?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Park vehicles permanently on the line", "B": "Exceed statutory speed limits", "C": "Disregard traffic laws", "D": "Overtake vehicles ahead and change lanes safely when road conditions permit"}, "explanation": "Broken white center lines indicate that overtaking and lane maneuvering are permitted with caution."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 92, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_1, Page 92", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 1", "Mock 4", "Road Markings"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1665", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "easy", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_4", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thirukkural_marunthu_adhikaram", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘மருந்தென வேண்டாவாம் யாக்கைக்கு அருந்தியது அற்றது போற்றி உணின்’ - இக்குறள் உணர்த்தும் முதன்மை நல்வாழ்வு நெறி யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "முன் உண்ட உணவு செரித்ததை அறிந்து, அளவோடு உண்டு வாழ்ந்தால் உடலுக்கு மருந்து என்ற ஒன்றே தேவையில்லை", "B": "அதிகமாக மருந்து மாத்திரைகளை உட்கொள்வது", "C": "உணவு உண்ணாமல் பட்டினி கிடப்பது", "D": "மருத்துவமனையில் தங்குவது"}, "explanation": "முன்பு உண்ட உணவு செரித்ததை உறுதிசெய்து கொண்டு மிதமாக உண்டால் மனித உடலுக்கு மருந்து தேவையில்லை என வள்ளுவர் இயற்கை மருத்துவ நெறியைக் கூறுகிறார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What foundational health principle is articulated in the Kural: 'Marunthena veendaavaam yaakkaikku arunthiyathu atrathu potri unin'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "If one consumes moderate food only after ensuring previous nourishment is fully digested, no medicine is ever needed for the body", "B": "Ingesting excess chemical pills", "C": "Fasting into starvation", "D": "Remaining hospitalized"}, "explanation": "Eating moderately only after previous digestion preserves sound health, making artificial medicine redundant."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "mar