{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1676", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_4", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "suradha_discipline_verse", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘எழுத்தாளர் ஆவதற்கு வெறும் எண்ணம் மட்டும் போதாது; சொல்லாட்சியும் இலக்கணக் கட்டுப்பாடும் கடின உழைப்பும் வேண்டும்’ - இதனை வலியுறுத்தும் கவிதை எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பிறகொரு நாள் கோடை", "B": "நெடுநல்வாடை", "C": "இடையீடு", "D": "இதில் வெற்றி பெற (சுரதா)"}, "explanation": "சுரதா 'இதில் வெற்றி பெற' கவிதையில் சொற்களைச் செதுக்கி, யாப்பறிந்து உழைத்து எழுதினால்தான் அழியாத கவிதை பிறக்கும் என வழிகாட்டுகிறார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which poem emphasizes: 'Mere romantic passion is insufficient to become a true poet; one requires linguistic discipline, prosodic mastery, and relentless craftsmanship'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Piragoru Naal Kodai", "B": "Nedunalvaadai", "C": "Idaiyeedu", "D": "Idhil Vetri Pera (Suradha)"}, "explanation": "Suradha's 'Idhil Vetri Pera' instructs aspiring writers to master linguistic rigors and tireless craftsmanship."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "