{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1681", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "easy", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "sirpi_poetic_symbols", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சிற்பி பாலசுப்பிரமணியத்தின் ‘இளந்தமிழே’ கவிதையில் ‘மீண்டும் அந்தப் பழமைநலம் புதுக்கு தற்கு... கூண்டுதனை உடைத்தெழுந்த சிங்கம் போலே’ என விளிக்கப்படுவது எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "தமிழ் அன்னை / தமிழ் மொழி", "B": "இமயமலை", "C": "கங்கை நதி", "D": "தென்றல் காற்று"}, "explanation": "சிற்பி பாலசுப்பிரமணியம் அடிமைத்தளையை உடைத்து எழும் சிங்கமாகத் தமிழ் மொழியை உருவகித்துப் பாடியுள்ளார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In Sirpi Balasubramaniam's 'Ilanthamizhe', who is exhorted to rise like a fierce lion shattering its cage to renew ancient splendor?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Mother Tamil / The Tamil Language", "B": "The Himalayas", "C": "River Ganges", "D": "Gentle southern breeze"}, "explanation": "He personifies the Tamil language as a majestic lion breaking free to illuminate the world afresh."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 2, "