{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1709", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_6", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "assertion_reason_suradha", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கூற்று (A): சுரதா தம் கவிதைகளில் மரபு யாப்பினை விடாமல் கையாண்டுள்ளார்.\nகாரணம் (R): மரபு யாப்பிலக்கணக் கட்டுப்பாட்டிற்குள் நின்று புதிய உவமைகளைப் படைப்பதே கவிதைக்கு நிலையான அழகைத் தரும் என்பது அவரது நம்பிக்கை.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"கூற்று (A) மற்றும் காரணம் (R) இரண்டும் சரி; காரணம் கூற்றை விளக்குகிறது.", "B": "\"கூற்று (A) சரி, ஆனால் காரணம் (R) தவறு.", "C": "\"கூற்று (A) தவறு, ஆனால் காரணம் (R) சரி.", "D": "\"கூற்று (A) மற்றும் காரணம் (R) இரண்டும் தவறு."}, "explanation": "சுரதா புதுக்கவிதை அலையிலும் யாப்பு மரபைக் கைவிடாமல் புதுப்புது உவமைகளை யாப்பில் அமைத்துப் பாடிய உவமைக் கவிஞர் ஆவார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Assertion (A): Suradha strictly adhered to classical metered prosody in his verses.\nReason (R): He maintained that creating fresh similes within strict prosodic rules endows poetry with timeless aesthetic durability.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"Both Assertion (A) and Reason (R) are correct; Reason correctly explains the Assertion.", "B": "\"Assertion (A) is correct, but Reason (R) is false.", "C": "\"Assertion (A) is false, but Reason (R) is correct.", "D": "\"Both Assertion (A) and Reason (R) are false."}, "explanation": "Suradha believed that adhering to traditional prosodic discipline while inventing fresh metaphors produces enduring poetry."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 78, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_1, Page 78", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 1", "Mock 6", "Assertion Reason"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1710", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_6", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "matching_masterclass_authors", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக (நூல் - ஆசிரியர்):\n(1) நிலவுப்பூ - (i) உத்தமசோழன்\n(2) கிழக்கு வாசல் உதயம் - (ii) சிற்பி பாலசுப்பிரமணியம்\n(3) தமிழர் குடும்ப முறை - (iii) பூமணி\n(4) வெக்கை - (iv) பக்தவத்சல பாரதி", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)", "B": "\"(1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iv), (4)-(iii)", "C": "\"(1)-(ii), (2)-(iv), (3)-(i), (4)-(iii)", "D": "\"(1)-(iii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iv), (4)-(ii)"}, "explanation": "நிலவுப்பூ = சிற்பி; கிழக்கு வாசல் உதயம் = உத்தமசோழன்; தமிழர் குடும்ப முறை = பக்தவத்சல பாரதி; வெக்கை = பூமணி. சரியான பொருத்தம்: (1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iv), (4)-(iii)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the following (Work - Author):\n(1) Nilavup Poo - (i) Uthamacholan\n(2) Kizhakku Vaasal Udhayam - (ii) Sirpi Balasubramaniam\n(3) Thamizhar Kudumba Murai - (iii) Poomani\n(4) Vekkai - (iv) Bhakthavatsala Bharathi", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)", "B": "\"(1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iv), (4)-(iii)", "C": "\"(1)-(ii), (2)-(iv), (3)-(i), (4)-(iii)", "D": "\"(1)-(iii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iv), (4)-(ii)"}, "explanation": "Nilavup Poo = Sirpi; Kizhakku Vaasal Udhayam = Uthamacholan; Thamizhar Kudumba Murai = Bhakthavatsala Bharathi; Vekkai = Poomani. Correct match: B."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 40, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_1, Page 40", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 1", "Mock 6", "Author Matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1711", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_6", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "statement_eval_kambar", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கீழ்க்கண்ட கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n(1) இராமன் குகனைத் தன் ஐந்தாவது தம்பியாக ஏற்றுக்கொண்டான்.\n(2) சவரி இராமனுக்கு நஞ்சூட்டிய பழங்களைத் தந்தாள்.\n(3) சடாயு சீதையைக் காக்கத் தன் சிறகுகளை இழந்து உயிர் துறந்தான்.\nஇவற்றுள் சரியான கூற்றுகள் எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"(1) மற்றும் (2) மட்டுமே சரி", "B": "\"(2) மற்றும் (3) மட்டுமே சரி", "C": "\"(1) மற்றும் (3) மட்டுமே சரி", "D": "அனைத்தும் சரி"}, "explanation": "கூற்று (2) தவறானது; சவரி இராமனுக்கு நஞ்சு ஊட்டவில்லை, சுவைத்த இனிமையான கனிந்த பழங்களை அன்போடு ஊட்டினாள். எனவே (1) மற்றும் (3) மட்டுமே சரி."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Evaluate the following statements regarding Kamba Ramayanam:\n(1) Rama embraced Guha as his fifth brother.\n(2) Shabari offered poisoned fruits to Rama.\n(3) Jatayu sacrificed his life fighting to defend Sita.\nWhich statements are correct?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1) and (2) only", "B": "(2) and (3) only", "C": "(1) and (3) only", "D": "All are correct"}, "explanation": "Statement (2) is false because Shabari offered sweet tested fruits, not poisoned ones. Thus (1) and (3) are correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 56, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_1, Page 56", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 1", "Mock 6", "Statement Analysis"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1712", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_6", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "assertion_reason_u_ve_sa", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கூற்று (A): உ.வே. சாமிநாதையர் ‘தமிழ்த்தாத்தா’ என்று அன்போடு அழைக்கப்படுகிறார்.\nகாரணம் (R): இவர் அழியும் நிலையில் இருந்த பண்டைத் தமிழ் ஓலைச்சுவடிகளைத் தேடித் தொகுத்துத் தம் வாழ்நாள் முழுதும் அச்சேற்றிப் பதிப்பித்தார்.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"கூற்று (A) சரி, ஆனால் காரணம் (R) தவறு.", "B": "\"கூற்று (A) தவறு, ஆனால் காரணம் (R) சரி.", "C": "\"கூற்று (A) மற்றும் காரணம் (R) இரண்டும் தவறு.", "D": "\"கூற்று (A) மற்றும் காரணம் (R) இரண்டும் சரி; காரணம் கூற்றை மிகச் சரியாக விளக்குகிறது."}, "explanation": "செவ்விலக்கியங்கள் அழிந்துவிடாமல் காப்பாற்றி அச்சேற்றிய பெரும் தியாகத்தால் உ.வே.சா 'தமிழ்த்தாத்தா' எனப் போற்றப்படுகிறார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Assertion (A): U.V. Swaminatha Iyer is affectionately revered as 'Tamizhppaatta'.\nReason (R): He dedicated his lifetime hunting, collecting, and critically publishing perishable ancient palm-leaf classical manuscripts into print.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"Assertion (A) is correct, but Reason (R) is false.", "B": "\"Assertion (A) is false, but Reason (R) is correct.", "C": "\"Both Assertion (A) and Reason (R) are false.", "D": "\"Both Assertion (A) and Reason (R) are correct; Reason correctly explains the Assertion."}, "explanation": "Both Assertion and Reason are true, accurately explaining the historical veneration of U.Ve.Sa as Tamizhppaatta."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 72, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_1, Page 72", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 1", "Mock 6", "Assertion Reason"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1713", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_6", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "matching_grammatical_terms", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக (இலக்கணக் கூறுகள் - சான்றுகள்):\n(1) திணைப் பொருத்தம் - (i) நாம் சென்றோம்\n(2) இடப் பொருத்தம் - (ii) மாடு புல் மேய்ந்தது\n(3) பால் பொருத்தம் - (iii) கண்ணன் பாடினான்\n(4) பொருள் மயக்கம் - (iv) அவன் சோ றுண்டான்", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"(1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)", "B": "\"(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)", "C": "\"(1)-(iii), (2)-(i), (3)-(ii), (4)-(iv)", "D": "\"(1)-(ii), (2)-(iii), (3)-(i), (4)-(iv)"}, "explanation": "திணைப் பொருத்தம் = மாடு புல் மேய்ந்தது; இடப் பொருத்தம் = நாம் சென்றோம்; பால் பொருத்தம் = கண்ணன் பாடினான்; பொருள் மயக்கம் = அவன் சோ றுண்டான். சரியான பொருத்தம்: (1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the following (Grammatical Rules - Examples):\n(1) Thinai Concord - (i) Naam sendrom\n(2) Idam Concord - (ii) Maadu pul meyndhathu\n(3) Paal Concord - (iii) Kannan paadinaan\n(4) Porul Mayakkam - (iv) Avan so rundaan", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"(1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)", "B": "\"(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)", "C": "\"(1)-(iii), (2)-(i), (3)-(ii), (4)-(iv)", "D": "\"(1)-(ii), (2)-(iii), (3)-(i), (4)-(iv)"}, "explanation": "Thinai = Maadu pul meyndhathu; Idam = Naam sendrom; Paal = Kannan paadinaan; Porul Mayakkam = Avan so rundaan. Correct match: A."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 66, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_1, Page 66", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 1", "Mock 6", "Grammar Matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1714", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_6", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "statement_eval_nedunalvaadai", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "நெடுநல்வாடை பற்றிய கீழ்க்கண்ட கூற்றுகளுள் தவறானது எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"நெடுநல்வாடை பத்துப்பாட்டு நூல்களுள் ஒன்றாகும்.", "B": "\"இதனை இயற்றியவர் கபிலர் ஆவார்.", "C": "\"இது 188 அடிகளைக் கொண்ட ஆசிரியப்பாவால் இயற்றப்பட்டது.", "D": "\"பாட்டுடைத் தலைவன் தலையாலங்கானத்துச் செருவென்ற பாண்டியன் நெடுஞ்செழியன்."}, "explanation": "கூற்று B தவறானது. நெடுநல்வாடையை இயற்றியவர் நக்கீரர் ஆவார்; கபிலர் அல்லர்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which of the following statements regarding Nedunalvaadai is INCORRECT?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"Nedunalvaadai is one of the ten anthologies of Pathuppaattu.", "B": "\"It was authored by the poet Kabilar.", "C": "\"It is composed in 188 lines of Asiriyappa meter.", "D": "\"Its royal hero is Pandyan Nedunchezhiyan victor of Thalaiyalanganam."}, "explanation": "Statement B is false because Nedunalvaadai was composed by Nakkeerar, not Kabilar."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 32, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_1, Page 32", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 1", "Mock 6", "Fact Verification"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1715", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_6", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "assertion_reason_avvaiyar", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கூற்று (A): ஔவையார் அதியமானின் தூதுவராகத் தொண்டைமானின் படைக்கலக் கொட்டிலைப் பார்வையிட்டார்.\nகாரணம் (R): தொண்டைமானின் ஆயுதங்கள் போரினால் சேதமடையாமல் நெய் பூசிப் பளபளப்பாக இருந்ததைக் கண்டு அவன் போர்க்கள அனுபவமற்றவன் என்பதை ஔவையார் உணர்த்தினார்.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"கூற்று (A) சரி, ஆனால் காரணம் (R) தவறு.", "B": "\"கூற்று (A) தவறு, ஆனால் காரணம் (R) சரி.", "C": "\"கூற்று (A) மற்றும் காரணம் (R) இரண்டும் சரி; காரணம் கூற்றை விளக்குகிறது.", "D": "\"கூற்று (A) மற்றும் காரணம் (R) இரண்டும் தவறு."}, "explanation": "ஔவையார் தொண்டைமானின் virgin ஆயுதங்களையும் அதியமானின் போர்க்களப் புண்பட்ட வேல்களையும் ஒப்பிட்டுப் போரைத் தடுத்தார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Assertion (A): Avvaiyar inspected King Thondaiman's armory as Adiyaman's diplomatic envoy.\nReason (R): Observing Thondaiman's spears polished with ghee and devoid of battle dents, Avvaiyar revealed that he lacked combat experience compared to Adiyaman.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"Assertion (A) is correct, but Reason (R) is false.", "B": "\"Assertion (A) is false, but Reason (R) is correct.", "C": "\"Both Assertion (A) and Reason (R) are correct; Reason correctly explains the Assertion.", "D": "\"Both Assertion (A) and Reason (R) are false."}, "explanation": "Both statements are factually correct; Avvaiyar's inspection served as a calculated diplomatic psychological maneuver."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 86, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_1, Page 86", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 1", "Mock 6", "Diplomatic Analysis"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1716", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_6", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "matching_prosodic_terms", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக (நூல் - பா வகை):\n(1) திருக்குறள் - (i) எண்சீர் விருத்தம்\n(2) நெடுநல்வாடை - (ii) குறள் வெண்பா\n(3) தன்னேர் இலாத தமிழ் - (iii) ஆசிரியப்பா\n(4) இதில் வெற்றி பெற - (iv) நேரிசை வெண்பா", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)", "B": "\"(1)-(iii), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iv), (4)-(i)", "C": "\"(1)-(iv), (2)-(iii), (3)-(ii), (4)-(i)", "D": "\"(1)-(ii), (2)-(iii), (3)-(iv), (4)-(i)"}, "explanation": "திருக்குறள் = குறள் வெண்பா; நெடுநல்வாடை = ஆசிரியப்பா; தன்னேர் இலாத தமிழ் = நேரிசை வெண்பா; இதில் வெற்றி பெற = எண்சீர் கழிநெடிலடி ஆசிரிய விருத்தம். சரியான பொருத்தம்: (1)-(ii), (2)-(iii), (3)-(iv), (4)-(i)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the classical work with its poetic meter:\n(1) Thirukkural - (i) Ensira Virutham\n(2) Nedunalvaadai - (ii) Kural Venba\n(3) Thanneer Ilaadha Thamizh - (iii) Asiriyappa\n(4) Idhil Vetri Pera - (iv) Nerisai Venba", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)", "B": "\"(1)-(iii), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iv), (4)-(i)", "C": "\"(1)-(iv), (2)-(iii), (3)-(ii), (4)-(i)", "D": "\"(1)-(ii), (2)-(iii), (3)-(iv), (4)-(i)"}, "explanation": "Thirukkural = Kural Venba; Nedunalvaadai = Asiriyappa; Thanneer Ilaadha Thamizh = Nerisai Venba; Idhil Vetri Pera = Ensira Virutham. Correct match: D."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 88, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_1, Page 88", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 1", "Mock 6", "Prosody Matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1717", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_6", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "statement_eval_environmental_treaty", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சுற்றுச்சூழல் மற்றும் புவி வெப்பமயமாதல் பற்றிய கீழ்க்கண்ட கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n(1) பாரிஸ் காலநிலை மாநாடு 2015-இல் நடைபெற்றது.\n(2) புவி வெப்பமயமாதலால் பனிப்பாறைகள் உருகி கடல்மட்டம் உயர்கிறது.\n(3) கார்பன் டை ஆக்சைடு ஒரு பசுமைக்குடில் வாயு அல்ல.\nஇவற்றுள் சரியான கூற்றுகள் எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"(1) மற்றும் (2) மட்டுமே சரி", "B": "\"(2) மற்றும் (3) மட்டுமே சரி", "C": "\"(1) மற்றும் (3) மட்டுமே சரி", "D": "அனைத்தும் சரி"}, "explanation": "கூற்று (3) தவறானது; கார்பன் டை ஆக்சைடு மிக முதன்மையான பசுமைக்குடில் வாயுவாகும். எனவே (1) மற்றும் (2) மட்டுமே சரி."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Evaluate the following statements regarding climate change:\n(1) The Paris Climate Accord was adopted in 2015.\n(2) Global warming causes polar ice caps to melt, raising sea levels.\n(3) Carbon dioxide is not a greenhouse gas.\nWhich statements are correct?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1) and (2) only", "B": "(2) and (3) only", "C": "(1) and (3) only", "D": "All are correct"}, "explanation": "Statement (3) is false because CO2 is the chief greenhouse gas. Statements (1) and (2) are correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 27, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_1, Page 27", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 1", "Mock 6", "Ecology Evaluation"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1718", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_6", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "matching_journals_editors", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக (இதழ்கள் - ஆசிரியர்கள்):\n(1) காவியம் - (i) சி.சு. செல்லப்பா\n(2) எழுத்து - (ii) சுரதா\n(3) சூரியோதயம் - (iii) உத்தமசோழன்\n(4) கிழக்கு வாசல் உதயம் - (iv) பரலி சு. நெல்லையப்பர்", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)", "B": "\"(1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iv), (4)-(iii)", "C": "\"(1)-(iii), (2)-(i), (3)-(ii), (4)-(iv)", "D": "\"(1)-(ii), (2)-(iv), (3)-(i), (4)-(iii)"}, "explanation": "காவியம் = சுரதா; எழுத்து = சி.சு. செல்லப்பா; சூரியோதயம் = பரலி சு. நெல்லையப்பர்; கிழக்கு வாசல் உதயம் = உத்தமசோழன். சரியான பொருத்தம்: (1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iv), (4)-(iii)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the literary journals with their respective editors:\n(1) Kaaviyam - (i) C.S. Chellappa\n(2) Ezhuthu - (ii) Suradha\n(3) Sooriyodhayam - (iii) Uthamacholan\n(4) Kizhakku Vaasal Udhayam - (iv) Parali Su. Nellaiyappar", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)", "B": "\"(1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iv), (4)-(iii)", "C": "\"(1)-(iii), (2)-(i), (3)-(ii), (4)-(iv)", "D": "\"(1)-(ii), (2)-(iv), (3)-(i), (4)-(iii)"}, "explanation": "Kaaviyam = Suradha; Ezhuthu = C.S. Chellappa; Sooriyodhayam = Nellaiyappar; Kizhakku Vaasal Udhayam = Uthamacholan. Correct match: B."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 40, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_1, Page 40", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 1", "Mock 6", "Periodicals Matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1719", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_6", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "assertion_reason_traffic_safety", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கூற்று (A): மோட்டார் வாகனச் சட்டத்தின்படி தலைக்கவசம் (Helmet) அணிவது கட்டாயமாக்கப்பட்டுள்ளது.\nகாரணம் (R): இருசக்கர வாகன விபத்துகளில் ஏற்படும் உயிரிழப்புகளில் 80%-க்கும் அதிகமானவை தலையில் ஏற்படும் தீவிரக் காயங்களாலேயே நிகழ்கின்றன.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"கூற்று (A) சரி, ஆனால் காரணம் (R) தவறு.", "B": "\"கூற்று (A) தவறு, ஆனால் காரணம் (R) சரி.", "C": "\"கூற்று (A) மற்றும் காரணம் (R) இரண்டும் சரி; காரணம் கூற்றை மிகச் சரியாக விளக்குகிறது.", "D": "\"கூற்று (A) மற்றும் காரணம் (R) இரண்டும் தவறு."}, "explanation": "இருசக்கர வாகன ஓட்டிகளின் தலையைப் பாதுகாத்து உயிரிழப்பைத் தடுப்பதே தலைக்கவசச் சட்டத்தின் மூல நோக்கமாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Assertion (A): Wearing crash helmets is legally mandated under the Motor Vehicles Act.\nReason (R): Over 80% of two-wheeler road fatalities result directly from traumatic head and brain injuries.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"Assertion (A) is correct, but Reason (R) is false.", "B": "\"Assertion (A) is false, but Reason (R) is correct.", "C": "\"Both Assertion (A) and Reason (R) are correct; Reason accurately explains the Assertion.", "D": "\"Both Assertion (A) and Reason (R) are false."}, "explanation": "Both statements are empirically true and logically validate the mandate."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 93, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_1, Page 93", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 1", "Mock 6", "Road Safety Logic"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1720", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_6", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "statement_eval_thinnai_schools", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பண்டைய காலத்துத் திண்ணைப் பள்ளிக்கூடங்கள் பற்றிய கீழ்க்கண்ட கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n(1) தொடக்கத்தில் மாணவர்கள் தரையில் மணலைப் பரப்பி விரல்களால் எழுதிப் பழகினர்.\n(2) சுவடிகளில் எழுத எழுத்தாணிகள் பயன்படுத்தப்பட்டன.\n(3) திண்ணைப் பள்ளிகளில் பெண்களுக்கு எவ்விதக் கல்வியும் கற்பிக்கப்படவில்லை.\nஇவற்றுள் சரியான கூற்றுகள் எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"(1) மற்றும் (3) மட்டுமே சரி", "B": "\"(2) மற்றும் (3) மட்டுமே சரி", "C": "\"அனைத்தும் சரி", "D": "\"(1) மற்றும் (2) மட்டுமே சரி"}, "explanation": "கூற்று (3) தவறானது; சங்க காலத்திலிருந்தே ஔவையார், வெள்ளிவீதியார் போன்ற பெண்பாற்புலவர்கள் விளங்கியதும், திண்ணைப் பள்ளிகளில் பெண்கள் எழுத்தறிவு பெற்றதும் ஆவணப்படுத்தப்பட்டுள்ளது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Evaluate the following statements regarding ancient Thinnai schools:\n(1) Initially, students practiced tracing letters on fine sand with fingers.\n(2) Iron styluses (Ezhuththaani) were used to inscribe palm leaves.\n(3) Women were completely barred from any form of education in Thinnai schools.\nWhich statements are correct?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1) and (3) only", "B": "(2) and (3) only", "C": "All are correct", "D": "(1) and (2) only"}, "explanation": "Statement (3) is false because women actively acquired literacy, producing celebrated poetesses. Statements (1) and (2) are correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 74, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_1, Page 74", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 1", "Mock 6", "Education History"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1721", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_6", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "matching_sangam_characters", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக (கம்பராமாயணக் கதைமாந்தர் - இராமனுடன் ஏற்பட்ட உறவு):\n(1) குகன் - (i) தந்தை போன்ற பெரியோன்\n(2) சடாயு - (ii) ஐந்தாவது உடன்பிறப்பு\n(3) சவரி - (iii) ஏழாவது உடன்பிறப்பு (அடைக்கலம்)\n(4) வீடணன் - (iv) தாய்மைப் பாசம் காட்டிய தவமுதியவள்", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"(1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iv), (4)-(iii)", "B": "\"(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)", "C": "\"(1)-(ii), (2)-(iv), (3)-(i), (4)-(iii)", "D": "\"(1)-(iii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iv), (4)-(ii)"}, "explanation": "குகன் = ஐந்தாவது உடன்பிறப்பு; சடாயு = தந்தை போன்ற பெரியோன்; சவரி = தாய்மை காட்டிய மூதாட்டி; வீடணன் = ஏழாவது உடன்பிறப்பு. சரியான பொருத்தம்: (1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iv), (4)-(iii)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the Kamba Ramayanam characters with their fraternal/filial relationship with Rama:\n(1) Guha - (i) Paternal elder\n(2) Jatayu - (ii) Fifth brother\n(3) Shabari - (iii) Seventh brother (Refugee)\n(4) Vibhishana - (iv) Maternal ascetic elder", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"(1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iv), (4)-(iii)", "B": "\"(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)", "C": "\"(1)-(ii), (2)-(iv), (3)-(i), (4)-(iii)", "D": "\"(1)-(iii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iv), (4)-(ii)"}, "explanation": "Guha = 5th brother; Jatayu = father-figure; Shabari = maternal figure; Vibhishana = 7th brother. Correct match: A."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 56, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_1, Page 56", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 1", "Mock 6", "Kambar Characters"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1722", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_6", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "assertion_reason_poomani", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கூற்று (A): பூமணியின் ‘உரிமைத்தாகம்’ கரிசல் நில மக்களின் வாழ்வியலை அப்பட்டமாகப் பேசுகிறது.\nகாரணம் (R): கரிசல் வட்டார வழக்குச் சொற்களையும், வறுமையிலும் உறவுகளின் பாசத்தை இழக்காத மனிதர்களின் தியாகத்தையும் கதை மையமாகக் கொண்டுள்ளது.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"கூற்று (A) சரி, ஆனால் காரணம் (R) தவறு.", "B": "\"கூற்று (A) மற்றும் காரணம் (R) இரண்டும் சரி; காரணம் கூற்றை மிகச் சரியாக விளக்குகிறது.", "C": "\"கூற்று (A) தவறு, ஆனால் காரணம் (R) சரி.", "D": "\"கூற்று (A) மற்றும் காரணம் (R) இரண்டும் தவறு."}, "explanation": "பூமணி கரிசல் வட்டார வழக்கையும், எளிய விவசாயிகளின் நிலப் பற்றையும் உயிர்ப்போடு சித்தரித்துள்ளார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Assertion (A): Poomani's 'Urimai Thaagam' authentically reflects the agrarian reality of Karisal black-soil peasants.\nReason (R): The story centers on regional dialect idioms and fraternal solidarity that endures despite biting poverty.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"Assertion (A) is correct, but Reason (R) is false.", "B": "\"Both Assertion (A) and Reason (R) are correct; Reason accurately explains the Assertion.", "C": "\"Assertion (A) is false, but Reason (R) is correct.", "D": "\"Both Assertion (A) and Reason (R) are false."}, "explanation": "Both statements are correct; Poomani's story captures dialect authenticity and agrarian resilience."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 61, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_1, Page 61", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 1", "Mock 6", "Poomani Realism"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1723", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_6", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "matching_grammatical_concord_errors", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக (பிழையான தொடர் - திருத்தப்பட்ட சரியான தொடர்):\n(1) மாடுகள் வந்தது - (i) அவன் வந்தான்\n(2) அவன் வந்தது - (ii) மாடுகள் வந்தன\n(3) நாங்கள் சென்றார்கள் - (iii) நாங்கள் சென்றோம்", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii)", "B": "\"(1)-(iii), (2)-(i), (3)-(ii)", "C": "\"(1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iii)", "D": "\"(1)-(ii), (2)-(iii), (3)-(i)"}, "explanation": "மாடுகள் வந்தது -> மாடுகள் வந்தன (அஃறிணைப் பன்மை); அவன் வந்தது -> அவன் வந்தான் (உயர்திணை ஆண்பால்); நாங்கள் சென்றார்கள் -> நாங்கள் சென்றோம் (தன்மைப் பன்மை). சரியான பொருத்தம்: (1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iii)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the faulty concord sentences with their grammatically corrected equivalents:\n(1) Maadugal vanthathu - (i) Avan vanthaan\n(2) Avan vanthathu - (ii) Maadugal vanthana\n(3) Naangal sendraargal - (iii) Naangal sendrom", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii)", "B": "\"(1)-(iii), (2)-(i), (3)-(ii)", "C": "\"(1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iii)", "D": "\"(1)-(ii), (2)-(iii), (3)-(i)"}, "explanation": "Maadugal vanthathu -> vanthana; Avan vanthathu -> vanthaan; Naangal sendraargal -> sendrom. Correct match: C."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 19, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_1, Page 19", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 1", "Mock 6", "Grammar Concord"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1724", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_6", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "statement_eval_ci_mani", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கவிஞர் சி. மணி பற்றிய கீழ்க்கண்ட கூற்றுகளுள் தவறானது எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"இவர் இயற்பெயர் எஸ். பழனிச்சாமி ஆகும்.", "B": "\"இவர் ‘எழுத்து’ இதழில் தொடர்ந்து கவிதைகள் எழுதினார்.", "C": "\"இவர் ‘வே. மாலி’ என்ற புனைப்பெயரிலும் கவிதைகள் எழுதியுள்ளார்.", "D": "\"இவர் கவிதைக்காக இருமுறை சாகித்திய அகாதெமி விருது பெற்றுள்ளார்."}, "explanation": "கூற்று D தவறானது; இருமுறை சாகித்திய அகாதெமி விருது பெற்றவர் சிற்பி பாலசுப்பிரமணியம் ஆவார். சி. மணி ஆசான் கவிதை விருது முதலான பிற விருதுகளைப் பெற்றுள்ளார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which of the following statements regarding poet C. Mani is INCORRECT?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"His given personal name was S. Palanichamy.", "B": "\"He contributed avant-garde verses regularly to the journal 'Ezhuthu'.", "C": "\"He frequently published verses under the pen name 'Ve. Maali'.", "D": "\"He won the Sahitya Akademi Award twice for his poetry."}, "explanation": "Statement D is false because it was Sirpi Balasubramaniam who won the Sahitya Akademi Award twice."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 83, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_1, Page 83", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 1", "Mock 6", "Author Verification"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1725", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_6", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "assertion_reason_rumi_guest", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கூற்று (A): ரூமியின் ‘விருந்தினர் இல்லம்’ கவிதை இன்ப துன்பங்களை சமமாக ஏற்குமாறு கூறுகிறது.\nகாரணம் (R): மனிதனின் உள்ளத்திற்குள் வரும் ஒவ்வொரு உணர்வும் ஆன்மாவைத் தூய்மைப்படுத்திப் புதிய வழியைக் காட்டும் இறைத் தூதுவர்களாகவே வருகின்றன.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"கூற்று (A) மற்றும் காரணம் (R) இரண்டும் சரி; காரணம் கூற்றை மிகச் சரியாக விளக்குகிறது.", "B": "\"கூற்று (A) சரி, ஆனால் காரணம் (R) தவறு.", "C": "\"கூற்று (A) தவறு, ஆனால் காரணம் (R) சரி.", "D": "\"கூற்று (A) மற்றும் காரணம் (R) இரண்டும் தவறு."}, "explanation": "ரூமியின் சூஃபி மெய்ஞ்ஞானம் அனைத்து உணர்வுகளையும் ஆத்மாவைச் செம்மைப்படுத்தும் இறைவனின் தூதுவர்களாக ஏற்று வாழ வழிகாட்டுகிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Assertion (A): Rumi's poem 'The Guest House' teaches equanimous acceptance of both joy and sorrow.\nReason (R): Every arriving emotion purifies the soul and arrives as an emissary sent from beyond to guide human consciousness.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"Both Assertion (A) and Reason (R) are correct; Reason correctly explains the Assertion.", "B": "\"Assertion (A) is correct, but Reason (R) is false.", "C": "\"Assertion (A) is false, but Reason (R) is correct.", "D": "\"Both Assertion (A) and Reason (R) are false."}, "explanation": "Both statements are true; Rumi's mystical philosophy treats every emotion as a celestial guide."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 48, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_1, Page 48", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 1", "Mock 6", "Sufi Wisdom"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1726", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_6", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "matching_traffic_rules", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக (போக்குவரத்துச் சைகைகள் - பொருள்):\n(1) சிவப்பு விளக்கு - (i) கவனமாக முந்திச் செல்லலாம்\n(2) தொடர் வெள்ளைக் கோடு - (ii) நிற்க\n(3) விட்டுவிட்ட வெள்ளைக் கோடு - (iii) முந்திச் செல்லக் கூடாது (No Overtaking)", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii)", "B": "\"(1)-(ii), (2)-(iii), (3)-(i)", "C": "\"(1)-(iii), (2)-(ii), (3)-(i)", "D": "\"(1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iii)"}, "explanation": "சிவப்பு விளக்கு = நிற்க; தொடர் வெள்ளைக் கோடு = முந்திச் செல்லக் கூடாது; விட்டுவிட்ட வெள்ளைக் கோடு = கவனமாக முந்திச் செல்லலாம். சரியான பொருத்தம்: (1)-(ii), (2)-(iii), (3)-(i)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the roadway safety regulations with their operational meanings:\n(1) Red Signal - (i) Overtake with caution\n(2) Solid White Line - (ii) Halt\n(3) Broken White Line - (iii) No Overtaking", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii)", "B": "\"(1)-(ii), (2)-(iii), (3)-(i)", "C": "\"(1)-(iii), (2)-(ii), (3)-(i)", "D": "\"(1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iii)"}, "explanation": "Red = Halt; Solid line = No overtaking; Broken line = Overtake with caution. Correct match: B."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 92, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_1, Page 92", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 1", "Mock 6", "Road Markings"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1727", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_6", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "statement_eval_tamil_family_system", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘தமிழர் குடும்ப முறை’ பற்றிய கீழ்க்கண்ட கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n(1) சங்க காலத்தில் தாய்வழிச் சமூக அமைப்பின் எச்சங்கள் நிலவின.\n(2) ‘குடும்பம்’ என்ற சொல் தொல்காப்பியத்தில் பலமுறை பயின்றுவந்துள்ளது.\n(3) மருத நிலத்து வேளாண்மை உற்பத்தி முறையே தனிக் குடும்பங்கள் உருவாகக் காரணமாயிற்று.\nஇவற்றுள் சரியான கூற்றுகள் எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"(1) மற்றும் (2) மட்டுமே சரி", "B": "\"(2) மற்றும் (3) மட்டுமே சரி", "C": "\"(1) மற்றும் (3) மட்டுமே சரி", "D": "அனைத்தும் சரி"}, "explanation": "கூற்று (2) தவறானது; 'குடும்பம்' என்ற சொல் தொல்காப்பியத்தில் இடம்பெறவில்லை. அது முதன்முதலில் திருக்குறளிலேயே பயின்றுவந்துள்ளது. எனவே (1) மற்றும் (3) மட்டுமே சரி."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Evaluate the following statements regarding the Tamil family system:\n(1) Vestiges of matrilineal kinship systems survived in the Sangam era.\n(2) The specific word 'Kudumbam' appears repeatedly in Tholkappiyam.\n(3) Settled agrarian mode of production in Marutham fostered nuclear family households.\nWhich statements are correct?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1) and (2) only", "B": "(2) and (3) only", "C": "(1) and (3) only", "D": "All are correct"}, "explanation": "Statement (2) is false because 'Kudumbam' never occurs in Tholkappiyam; it first appears in Thirukkural. Statements (1) and (3) are correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 44, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_1, Page 44", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 1", "Mock 6", "Anthropology Analysis"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1728", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_6", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "assertion_reason_climate_mitigation", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கூற்று (A): காடுகள் அழிக்கப்படுவதும் வாகனப் புகையும் புவி வெப்பமயமாதலைத் தீவிரப்படுத்துகின்றன.\nகாரணம் (R): மரங்கள் கார்பன் டை ஆக்சைடை உறிஞ்சி ஆக்ஸிஜனை வெளியிடுவதால் காடழிப்பு நிகழும்போது வளிமண்டலத்தில் வெப்பம் தக்கவைக்கப்பட்டுப் பூமி வெப்பமடைகிறது.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"கூற்று (A) சரி, ஆனால் காரணம் (R) தவறு.", "B": "\"கூற்று (A) தவறு, ஆனால் காரணம் (R) சரி.", "C": "\"கூற்று (A) மற்றும் காரணம் (R) இரண்டும் தவறு.", "D": "\"கூற்று (A) மற்றும் காரணம் (R) இரண்டும் சரி; காரணம் கூற்றை மிகச் சரியாக விளக்குகிறது."}, "explanation": "மரங்கள் இயற்கையான கார்பன் சேமிப்புக் கிடங்குகளாக விளங்குவதால் காடழிப்பு புவி வெப்பமயமாதலுக்கு நேரடிக் காரணமாகிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Assertion (A): Deforestation and vehicular emissions accelerate global climate change.\nReason (R): Because trees absorb CO2 and release oxygen, the loss of forests traps excess greenhouse heat in the atmosphere.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"Assertion (A) is correct, but Reason (R) is false.", "B": "\"Assertion (A) is false, but Reason (R) is correct.", "C": "\"Both Assertion (A) and Reason (R) are false.", "D": "\"Both Assertion (A) and Reason (R) are correct; Reason accurately explains the Assertion."}, "explanation": "Both statements are scientifically accurate and establish direct causation."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 27, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_1, Page 27", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 1", "Mock 6", "Ecology Logic"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1729", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_6", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "matching_poets_titles", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக (புலவர்கள்/கவிஞர்கள் - சிறப்புப் பட்டப் பெயர்கள்):\n(1) சுரதா - (i) உவமைக் கவிஞர்\n(2) உ.வே. சாமிநாதையர் - (ii) தமிழ்த்தாத்தா\n(3) கம்பர் - (iii) கவிச்சக்கரவர்த்தி\n(4) பாரதியார் - (iv) மகாகவி", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)", "B": "\"(1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iv), (4)-(iii)", "C": "\"(1)-(iii), (2)-(i), (3)-(ii), (4)-(iv)", "D": "\"(1)-(iv), (2)-(iii), (3)-(ii), (4)-(i)"}, "explanation": "சுரதா = உவமைக் கவிஞர்; உ.வே.சா = தமிழ்த்தாத்தா; கம்பர் = கவிச்சக்கரவர்த்தி; பாரதியார் = மகாகவி. சரியான பொருத்தம்: (1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the literary figures with their celebrated honorific titles:\n(1) Suradha - (i) Uvamai Kavignar\n(2) U.V. Swaminatha Iyer - (ii) Tamizhppaatta\n(3) Kambar - (iii) Kavichakravarti\n(4) Bharathiyar - (iv) Mahakavi", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)", "B": "\"(1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iv), (4)-(iii)", "C": "\"(1)-(iii), (2)-(i), (3)-(ii), (4)-(iv)", "D": "\"(1)-(iv), (2)-(iii), (3)-(ii), (4)-(i)"}, "explanation": "Suradha = Uvamai Kavignar; U.Ve.Sa = Tamizhppaatta; Kambar = Kavichakravarti; Bharathi = Mahakavi. Correct match: A."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 88, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_1, Page 88", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 1", "Mock 6", "Epithets Matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1730", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_6", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "statement_eval_mudhalkal", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘முதல் கல்’ சிறுகதை பற்றிய கீழ்க்கண்ட கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n(1) இக்கதையின் ஆசிரியர் உத்தமசோழன் ஆவார்.\n(2) கதையில் மதகில் அடைத்துக் கிடந்த வெங்காயத்தாமரையை மருதன் தனி ஆளாக இறங்கி அகற்றத் தொடங்கினான்.\n(3) ஊர்மக்கள் மருதனுக்கு எவ்வித உதவியும் செய்யாமல் வேடிக்கை மட்டுமே பார்த்தனர்.\nஇவற்றுள் சரியான கூற்றுகள் எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"(1) மற்றும் (3) மட்டுமே சரி", "B": "\"(1) மற்றும் (2) மட்டுமே சரி", "C": "\"(2) மற்றும் (3) மட்டுமே சரி", "D": "அனைத்தும் சரி"}, "explanation": "கூற்று (3) தவறானது; மருதன் இறங்கி உழைப்பதைப் பார்த்து ஊர்மக்கள் அனைவரும் திரண்டு வந்து இணைந்து வேலை செய்து பயிர்களைக் காப்பாற்றினர்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Evaluate the following statements regarding the short story 'Mudhal Kal':\n(1) The author of the story is Uthamacholan.\n(2) Maruthan stepped single-handedly into the canal to clear the clogged water hyacinth weeds.\n(3) The villagers remained passive spectators and offered zero help to Maruthan.\nWhich statements are correct?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1) and (3) only", "B": "(1) and (2) only", "C": "(2) and (3) only", "D": "All are correct"}, "explanation": "Statement (3) is false because Maruthan's initiative inspired the entire village to jump in and clear the breach. Statements (1) and (2) are correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 38, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_1, Page 38", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 1", "Mock 6", "Story Analysis"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1731", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_6", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "assertion_reason_porul_mayakkam", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கூற்று (A): எழுதும் போது சொற்களை உரிய இடத்தில் இடைவெளி விட்டு எழுத வேண்டும்.\nகாரணம் (R): தவறான இடங்களில் சொற்களைப் பிரிப்பதோ அல்லது சேர்ப்பதோ தொடரின் பொருளையே முற்றிலும் மாற்றிப் பொருள் மயக்கத்தை உண்டாக்கும்.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"கூற்று (A) சரி, ஆனால் காரணம் (R) தவறு.", "B": "\"கூற்று (A) தவறு, ஆனால் காரணம் (R) சரி.", "C": "\"கூற்று (A) மற்றும் காரணம் (R) இரண்டும் சரி; காரணம் கூற்றை மிகச் சரியாக விளக்குகிறது.", "D": "\"கூற்று (A) மற்றும் காரணம் (R) இரண்டும் தவறு."}, "explanation": "இடைவெளி தவறும் போது தவறான பொருள் தோன்றி வாக்கியத்தின் உண்மை நோக்கம் சிதைந்து போகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Assertion (A): Words in written Tamil must be spaced precisely according to grammatical boundaries.\nReason (R): Inappropriate compounding or arbitrary splitting distorts sentence semantics entirely, causing severe ambiguity (Porul Mayakkam).", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"Assertion (A) is correct, but Reason (R) is false.", "B": "\"Assertion (A) is false, but Reason (R) is correct.", "C": "\"Both Assertion (A) and Reason (R) are correct; Reason accurately explains the Assertion.", "D": "\"Both Assertion (A) and Reason (R) are false."}, "explanation": "Both statements are grammatically correct; spacing directly governs unambiguous syntax."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 67, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_1, Page 67", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 1", "Mock 6", "Grammar Syntax"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1732", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_6", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "matching_thirukkural_verses", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக (திருக்குறள் - அதிகாரம்):\n(1) அன்பு நாண் ஒப்புரவு - (i) சினம்\n(2) தன்னைத்தான் காக்கின் - (ii) சான்றாண்மை\n(3) தீயவை தீய பயத்தலான் - (iii) மருந்து\n(4) மருந்தென வேண்டாவாம் - (iv) தீவினையச்சம்", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)", "B": "\"(1)-(iii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iv), (4)-(ii)", "C": "\"(1)-(iv), (2)-(i), (3)-(ii), (4)-(iii)", "D": "\"(1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iv), (4)-(iii)"}, "explanation": "அன்பு நாண் = சான்றாண்மை; தன்னைத்தான் காக்கின் = சினம்; தீயவை தீய பயத்தலான் = தீவினையச்சம்; மருந்தென வேண்டாவாம் = மருந்து. சரியான பொருத்தம்: (1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iv), (4)-(iii)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the Thirukkural couplets with their respective chapters (Adhikarangal):\n(1) Anbu naan oppuravu - (i) Sinam (Anger)\n(2) Thannaithaan kaakkin - (ii) Saandraanmai (Nobility)\n(3) Theeyavai theeya payaththalaan - (iii) Marunthu (Medicine)\n(4) Marunthena veendaavaam - (iv) Theevinaiyacham (Dread of Sin)", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)", "B": "\"(1)-(iii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iv), (4)-(ii)", "C": "\"(1)-(iv), (2)-(i), (3)-(ii), (4)-(iii)", "D": "\"(1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iv), (4)-(iii)"}, "explanation": "Anbu naan = Saandraanmai; Thannaithaan kaakkin = Sinam; Theeyavai = Theevinaiyacham; Marunthena = Marunthu. Correct match: D."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 64, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_1, Page 64", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 1", "Mock 6", "Thirukkural Matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1733", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_6", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "statement_eval_kambar_poetic_craft", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கம்பராமாயணம் பற்றிய கீழ்க்கண்ட கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n(1) கம்பர் தாம் இயற்றிய காப்பியத்திற்கு ‘இராமாவதாரம்’ எனப் பெயரிட்டார்.\n(2) கம்பர் சோழ நாட்டில் உள்ள தேரழுந்தூரில் பிறந்தவர்.\n(3) கம்பரை ஆதரித்த வள்ளல் சீதக்காதி ஆவார்.\nஇவற்றுள் சரியான கூற்றுகள் எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"(1) மற்றும் (2) மட்டுமே சரி", "B": "\"(2) மற்றும் (3) மட்டுமே சரி", "C": "\"(1) மற்றும் (3) மட்டுமே சரி", "D": "அனைத்தும் சரி"}, "explanation": "கூற்று (3) தவறானது; கம்பரை ஆதரித்த வள்ளல் திருவெண்ணெய்நல்லூர் சடையப்ப வள்ளல் ஆவார். சீதக்காதி வள்ளல் உமறுப்புலவரை ஆதரித்தவர். எனவே (1) மற்றும் (2) மட்டுமே சரி."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Evaluate the following statements regarding Kamba Ramayanam:\n(1) Kambar originally named his epic 'Ramavataram'.\n(2) Kambar was born in Therazhundur in the Chola realm.\n(3) The munificent patron who supported Kambar was Seethakkathi.\nWhich statements are correct?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1) and (2) only", "B": "(2) and (3) only", "C": "(1) and (3) only", "D": "All are correct"}, "explanation": "Statement (3) is false because Kambar's patron was Sadaiyappa Vallal (Seethakkathi patronized Umaru Pulavar). Statements (1) and (2) are correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 52, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_1, Page 52", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 1", "Mock 6", "Kambar Verification"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1734", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_6", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "assertion_reason_ancient_education", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கூற்று (A): பண்டைத் தமிழ்நாட்டில் திண்ணைப் பள்ளிக்கூடங்களில் மனனப் பயிற்சிக்கு முக்கியத்துவம் தரப்பட்டது.\nகாரணம் (R): ஓலைச்சுவடிகள் அரிதாக இருந்த அக்காலத்தில் மாணவர்கள் பாடங்களையும் வாய்ப்பாடுகளையும் மனப்பாடம் செய்து நினைவில் நிறுத்துவது அவசியமாக இருந்தது.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"கூற்று (A) சரி, ஆனால் காரணம் (R) தவறு.", "B": "\"கூற்று (A) மற்றும் காரணம் (R) இரண்டும் சரி; காரணம் கூற்றை மிகச் சரியாக விளக்குகிறது.", "C": "\"கூற்று (A) தவறு, ஆனால் காரணம் (R) சரி.", "D": "\"கூற்று (A) மற்றும் காரணம் (R) இரண்டும் தவறு."}, "explanation": "அச்சு இயந்திரங்கள் இல்லாத சுவடிக் காலத்தில் வாய்மொழி மனனம் மூலமாகவே அறிவு அடுத்த தலைமுறைக்குக் கடத்தப்பட்டது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Assertion (A): Rote mnemonic memorization was accorded paramount emphasis in ancient Thinnai schools.\nReason (R): In an era when palm-leaf manuscripts were scarce and perishable, committing grammatical sutras and tables to memory was essential.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"Assertion (A) is correct, but Reason (R) is false.", "B": "\"Both Assertion (A) and Reason (R) are correct; Reason accurately explains the Assertion.", "C": "\"Assertion (A) is false, but Reason (R) is correct.", "D": "\"Both Assertion (A) and Reason (R) are false."}, "explanation": "Both statements are historically correct; oral mnemonics preserved knowledge before the advent of printing."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 75, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_1, Page 75", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 1", "Mock 6", "Pedagogy Rationale"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1735", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_6", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "matching_metaphor_examples", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக (உவமை - உருவகம்):\n(1) கயல் போன்ற விழி - (i) உருவகம் (முகமதி)\n(2) மதி போன்ற முகம் - (ii) உவமை (கயல்விழி)\n(3) முகமாகிய மதி - (iii) உவமை (மதிமுகம்)", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii)", "B": "\"(1)-(iii), (2)-(i), (3)-(ii)", "C": "\"(1)-(ii), (2)-(iii), (3)-(i)", "D": "\"(1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iii)"}, "explanation": "கயல் போன்ற விழி = கயல்விழி (உவமை); மதி போன்ற முகம் = மதிமுகம் (உவமை); முகமாகிய மதி = முகமதி (உருவகம்). சரியான பொருத்தம்: (1)-(ii), (2)-(iii), (3)-(i)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the figurative expressions with their grammatical classification:\n(1) Kayal pondra vizhi - (i) Metaphor (Mugamadhi)\n(2) Madhi pondra mugam - (ii) Simile (Kayalvizhi)\n(3) Mugamaagiya madhi - (iii) Simile (Madhimugam)", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii)", "B": "\"(1)-(iii), (2)-(i), (3)-(ii)", "C": "\"(1)-(ii), (2)-(iii), (3)-(i)", "D": "\"(1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iii)"}, "explanation": "Kayal vizhi = Simile; Madhi mugam = Simile; Muga madhi = Metaphor. Correct match: C."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 97, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_1, Page 97", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 1", "Mock 6", "Metaphor Matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1736", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_6", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "mock6_mastery_synthesis", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "திருப்புதல் மாதிரித் தேர்வு 6 வெளிப்படுத்தும் முதன்மையான வினாத்தாள் பகுப்பாய்வுத் திறன் யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"வினாக்களை மனப்பாடம் செய்வது மட்டுமே", "B": "\"எழுத்துக்களை எண்ணி எழுதுவது", "C": "\"பழைய வினாக்களை அப்படியே ஒப்புவிப்பது", "D": "\"கூற்று-காரணம், பொருத்துக மற்றும் கருத்தியல் பிழைகளைத் துல்லியமாக அடையாளம் கண்டு பகுப்பாய்வு செய்யும் TNPSC உயர்நிலைத் தேர்வுத் திறன்"}, "explanation": "உயர்நிலை வினாக்கள் மூலம் மாணவர்களின் ஆழமான புரிதலையும், வினாத்தாளைப் பகுத்தாய்ந்து சரியான விடையை நொடிக்குள் கண்டறியும் திறனையும் வளர்ப்பதே இதன் நோக்கமாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What primary analytical examination competency does Synoptic Mock Test 6 cultivate?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"Rote memory regurgitation", "B": "\"Counting letters mechanically", "C": "\"Verbatim recitation of past questions", "D": "\"High-order analytical mastery discerning Assertion-Reasoning, multi-statement validity, and matching matrices under TNPSC exam conditions"}, "explanation": "It trains candidates in rigorous critical discrimination demanded by high-level TNPSC Group 1/2 exams."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": 