{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1742", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_7", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "tnpsc_pyq_parali_nellaiyappar_books", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC Group 2A 2017] ‘பாரதி சரித்திரம்’ என்ற வாழ்க்கை வரலாற்று நூலை முதன்முதலில் எழுதியவர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"வ.ரா.", "B": "\"பரலி சு. நெல்லையப்பர்", "C": "\"செல்லம்மா பாரதி", "D": "\"பாரதிதாசன்"}, "explanation": "பாரதியாரின் மிக நெருங்கிய நண்பரான பரலி சு. நெல்லையப்பரே பாரதியின் மறைவிற்குப் பின் 'பாரதி சரித்திரம்' என்னும் நூலை முதன்முதலில் எழுதினார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC Group 2A 2017] Who was the first author to pen a comprehensive biographical memoir titled 'Bharathi Sarithiram'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"Va. Ra.", "B": "\"Parali Su. Nellaiyappar", "C": "\"Chellama Bharathi", "D": "\"Bharathidasan"}, "explanation": "Nellaiyappar wrote the pioneering biography 'Bharathi Sarithiram' commemorating his mentor."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 13, "chapter": null, "section":