{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1750", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_7", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "tnpsc_pyq_traffic_sign_hospital", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC Group 4 2021] சாலைகளில் ஒலியெழுப்புவது தடைசெய்யப்பட்ட பகுதி (Silent Zone / No Horn) என அறிவிக்கப்படும் இடங்கள் எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"திரையரங்குகள்", "B": "\"மருத்துவமனைகள் மற்றும் பள்ளிகள் (அருகே 100 மீட்டர் சுற்றளவு)", "C": "\"விளையாட்டு மைதானங்கள்", "D": "\"வணிக வளாகங்கள்"}, "explanation": "மருத்துவமனைகள், நீதிமன்றங்கள், கல்வி நிறுவனங்களைச் சுற்றியுள்ள 100 மீட்டர் பகுதி 'ஒலியெழுப்பக் கூடாத அமைதிப் பகுதி' (Silence Zone) ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC Group 4 2021] Which designated public zones prohibit motor vehicle horn honking (Silence Zones / No Horn)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"Cinema theaters", "B": "\"Hospitals, courts, and school campuses (within a 100-meter radius)", "C": "\"Sports stadiums", "D": "\"Commercial malls"}, "explanation": "Zones within 100 meters around hospitals, schools, and courts are legally designated Silence Zones."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Edu